msgid "Free Blog theme for 2022. It is perfect theme for news and magazine too. With masonry layout and multiple blog page layout, this theme is the awesome and minimal theme. It is a child theme of Polite. This theme has search option, off-canvas sidebar, multiple sidebar options, footer options, featured slider, promo boxed, footer widgets and many more. Besides that, this theme comes with added custom widgets for author information, featured posts, social icons, etc. It comes with primary color option to change the whole site color with a single click. More Details: https://www.templatesell.com/item/polite-minimal-blog-wordpress-theme/"
